{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_114_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_114_fc_01_title", "source_sha256": "364cc07bace9d69722fb5c487bb0470ab94444b18ce10e97b1ba8d6a33145eae", "ja": "奇跡の夜に……", "zh": "奇迹之夜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_114_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_114_fc_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "bf94a54acc0cb5aa158f115fb5aaad70af9e6b614e28c4c47f78829805c86ccf", "ja": "クリスマス公演の準備はオッケー！\n雪降る夜、にぎやかに出番を待つ\nアイドルたちの一幕です。", "zh": "圣诞公演的准备工作已经就绪！\n这是偶像们在飘雪的夜晚热闹地等待登场的一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_114_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_114_fc_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "a5027cb7e08c1813c6e0b37c325b38d9601f8115e5d8a4b47c4fdff2621f96b2", "ja": "（もうすぐ劇場のクリスマス公演だが、前の仕事が\n長引いてしまった。早く、みんなに合流しないと！）", "zh": "（剧场的圣诞公演马上就要开始了，可之前的工作拖得太久了。得快点和大家汇合才行！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_114_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_114_fc_01_1001_p", "source_sha256": "3dc8c09f68049feca416c9195d2d4d578200e9353c149c7c049d0e8ad7f5a579", "ja": "はぁ……はぁ……！　ごめんみんな。\n悪いんだけどすぐに着替えて……あれ？", "zh": "哈……哈……！对不起，大家。\n不好意思，能不能马上换好衣服……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_114_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_114_fc_01_1002_040tam", "source_sha256": "2a43b74e577682bf1467f00963c101555db0cf80b49898083482817ac8e3062c", "ja": "あ、きた！\nみんな～！　おやぶんきたぞー！", "zh": "啊，来了！\n大家——！老大来了——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_114_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_114_fc_01_1003_036kan", "source_sha256": "8a7b490f61354637ccdbe7c89e00acbfd8c0ba60484541d54eea3d9522a620c1", "ja": "えっ？　あっ、ホントだ～♪\n{$P$}さん、おかえりなさ～い♪", "zh": "咦？啊，真的耶～♪  \n{$P$}先生，欢迎回来～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_114_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_114_fc_01_1004_046rio", "source_sha256": "900ac06f0bc54f47e9dbb7778aabc8f7820024b2063b21b31192f549ba386389", "ja": "もうっ！　遅いわよ{$P$}くん。\n間に合わないかもって、心配しちゃったじゃない。", "zh": "真是的！你来得太晚了，{$P$}。\n我都担心你是不是赶不上了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_114_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_114_fc_01_1005_p", "source_sha256": "6041991577005b55e91e7d9b88d2c50cdd28e9f2aa9840995e09870faeee5ac5", "ja": "ごめんごめん。でも、先に着替えててくれたんだな。\nありがとう、助かったよ。", "zh": "抱歉抱歉。不过，你已经先换好衣服了啊。谢谢，帮大忙了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_114_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_114_fc_01_1006_007ior", "source_sha256": "6e44fdca7b44050c8aecfaaeb127133d31dd0e6eec1632ea806fe27f8c628196", "ja": "助かったよ、じゃないわよ。まったく。\nもう少し、プロデューサーとしての自覚を……っ！", "zh": "别只说什么“帮大忙了”。真是的。作为制作人，至少也该有点自觉……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_114_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_114_fc_01_1007_007ior", "source_sha256": "4c0e3c81a0d4eb5f0148b0aca655d02ac8459f597b3bc8777602484f47613d86", "ja": "はぁ……もういいわ。\nなんかその格好みてたら、怒る気も失せちゃった。", "zh": "唉……算了。\n看到你那副打扮，连生气的劲儿都没了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_114_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_114_fc_01_1008_p", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_114_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_114_fc_01_1009_027say", "source_sha256": "22bf8ccf00f692c7e946f86fb4ffa33e29755e1f23dec0959934d0e36b805459", "ja": "お待たせ！　着替えに少し手間取っちゃって……\nあっ、{$P$}！　……。", "zh": "让你久等了！换衣服稍微花了点时间……\n啊，{$P$}！……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_114_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_114_fc_01_1010_002chi", "source_sha256": "595c4328add35af1fcfb516c34508bae7ea17361ebb98d9be90570d66bddca98", "ja": "間に合ったんですね。よかった……！？\n……ぷっ、ふふ、ふふふっ！", "zh": "赶上了啊。太好了……！？……噗，呵呵，呵呵呵！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_114_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_114_fc_01_1011_p", "source_sha256": "c284f607dd5e06a327d76363212da0a4e4b0704eaf75eada1017a1cb242fe66b", "ja": "ち、千早？　どうしたんだ急に……。", "zh": "千、千早？怎么突然这样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_114_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_114_fc_01_1012_027say", "source_sha256": "2c8b1579acafcaf5b69b15c5032dcbb75a6476d52224cfe787d12990c9a47c64", "ja": "えっと、{$P$}。\nあの、頭の上に、雪が……。", "zh": "那个，{$P$}。\n你的头上……有雪……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_114_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_114_fc_01_1013_p", "source_sha256": "955841f7738f0d38eaaa59cf08699f43437082e5e930ece84fc2f950ab53e7d4", "ja": "頭の上……？　うわっ、つめたっ！\nき、気付かなかった……外は結構降ってたからな。", "zh": "头顶上……？呜哇，好冷！我、我都没注意到……外面下了挺大的雪啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_114_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_114_fc_01_1014_027say", "source_sha256": "e16c4365a69051eba5aec5cc0e52d901c42615c9f6cc65e0f147b5ff74e1d23a", "ja": "{$P$}。\nよかったら、このタオル使ってください。", "zh": "{$P$}。\n如果不介意的话，请用这条毛巾吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_114_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_114_fc_01_1015_p", "source_sha256": "23f43c44de8f2fca86371a53195a0c76a27284bac91e3e422803ab023820e214", "ja": "ああ、ありがとう……助かったよ。\nなるほど、それで千早は笑ってたんだな。", "zh": "啊，谢谢……帮大忙了。\n原来如此，千早就是因为这个才笑的啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_114_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_114_fc_01_1016_002chi", "source_sha256": "83ed6fc311abc57e10ee7d577b25c009da817c61153b0a221ddf030c31c14dc1", "ja": "すみません。雪だらけの{$P$}を見て\nいたら、スキーで転んだことを思い出してしまって。", "zh": "不好意思。看着满是积雪的{$P$}时，\n不由得想起了自己滑雪摔倒的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_114_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_114_fc_01_1017_027say", "source_sha256": "b9046c538a92b608e7a29fdf93957fb92a269b6e4dfe6ad416464babf2c52954", "ja": "ち、千早ちゃん！\nあれは恥ずかしいから忘れて～！", "zh": "千、千早！\n那件事太丢脸了，快忘掉吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_114_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_114_fc_01_1018_002chi", "source_sha256": "76bd5a8ab1d72ffe4cb3b6500bd8caca480d6f5f633eb8ff8bcc3722b39f1769", "ja": "ふふっ、ごめんなさい。けど、あんなふうに\n慌てる高山さんは、初めて見たから……。", "zh": "呵呵，对不起。不过，我还是第一次看到高山同学那样慌慌张张的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_114_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_114_fc_01_1019_046rio", "source_sha256": "f90f85879810e955ad4398ed0e09507d0ad2f8ab559f03407c4333abbb1e2185", "ja": "あら、ふたりとも……スキーなんて、いつしたの？\nその様子だと、ずいぶん楽しかったみたいじゃない。", "zh": "哎呀，你们两个……是什么时候去滑雪的？\n看你们那样子，似乎玩得特别开心呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_114_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_114_fc_01_1020_040tam", "source_sha256": "317bd8c0ad68bae1f3279d75762b638687c9e37da0a6d421245929981fa45fe3", "ja": "いいなー、ちはやとさよこ、ずるいぞー！\nおやぶん、たまきも行きたかったー！", "zh": "真好啊——千早和纱代子，你们太狡猾了！\n大叔，环也好想去啊——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_114_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_114_fc_01_1021_002chi", "source_sha256": "482a6fe53141789da68a2f8f62ceb578dbf3c38833e6159162abe1860f376dc9", "ja": "た、環……。えっと、私たちも、\n遊ぶために行ったわけじゃないから……。", "zh": "环、环……那个，我们也不是专程去玩的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_114_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_114_fc_01_1022_p", "source_sha256": "4a53c00fe4dd64a46be129a0b7ee456a3fd1a8ea78c9db764d991259f51ae8a7", "ja": "そうそう、仕事の空き時間に少し遊んだだけだよ。\nだから、みんなもまた別の機会があれば……。", "zh": "对对，只是在工作间隙稍微玩了一下而已。\n所以，大家下次要是还有别的机会……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_114_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_114_fc_01_1023_007ior", "source_sha256": "44b80926a17b46d7e82f33263e6418ebe0142b073d283fb07e60af553cfca173", "ja": "それなら仕方ないわね……なんて、納得するわけ\nないでしょ！　可奈、環。ふたりは、どう思う？", "zh": "既然这样，那也没办法……才怪，我怎么可能接受啊！\n可奈、环。你们两个觉得呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_114_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_114_fc_01_1024_036kan", "source_sha256": "a98102a9eed17f4c5744c302e9effa6926cf4678b6229f60e43cbd9182f94fe5", "ja": "みんなとおでかけ、可奈は好き～♪\n可奈もスキーに連れてってくださ～い！", "zh": "和大家一起出门，可奈最喜欢了～♪\n也请带可奈一起去滑雪吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_114_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_114_fc_01_1025_040tam", "source_sha256": "066ece55f47737d4d8240f118f56bcce77270cb0d3a52cbf6c27d4e1defdd98c", "ja": "おやぶん、たまき、お仕事がんばるぞ！\nあとね、いっぱいお手伝いする！　だから……。", "zh": "大哥，环，工作要加油啦！\n还有哦，环会帮好多忙！所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_114_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_114_fc_01_1026_046rio", "source_sha256": "a7de9e819997a8102cf9d50894f91c88fbe0d0fbc691d7aa091f068ac6e91add", "ja": "ふっふっふ……どう？　{$P$}くん。\n可愛いふたりのお願い、無下に断れるかしら！", "zh": "哼哼哼……怎么样，{$P$}先生？面对两个可爱女孩的请求，你忍心无情地拒绝吗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_114_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_114_fc_01_1027_p", "source_sha256": "3396f77b6709805e934124d1c76d999c5e4e4b0413a357f0398a71741ad25fd3", "ja": "うっ……卑怯だぞ、莉緒！　うーん、\nスケジュールを調整すればなんとかなる、か……？", "zh": "呜……太卑鄙了，莉绪！嗯——\n只要调整一下日程，应该还是能想办法的……吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_114_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_114_fc_01_1028_002chi", "source_sha256": "2e346ff658880a46c31e60021a244afea2f92c0cde8a074e389e9ecc4346c953", "ja": "{$P$}、すみません。\n私が笑ったせいでこんなことに……。", "zh": "{$P$}，对不起。\n都是因为我笑了，才会变成这样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_114_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_114_fc_01_1029_027say", "source_sha256": "16953721f0d75b724861dc919b790673df17ca2386b14a6ffa41a060bd72b375", "ja": "私も、大げさに反応してしまったので！\nその……予算的に、厳しいでしょうか……？", "zh": "我也反应得太夸张了！\n那个……从预算上来说，会不会有点困难……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_114_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_114_fc_01_1030_p", "source_sha256": "c3d94be967d23702e91b07b5ae8b5454c4b78076b0a9f76b25cb64c66a2386b1", "ja": "そこは気にしなくていいよ、紗代子。元々、\n公演が終わったら、何か打ち上げを考えてたし。", "zh": "不用在意这个，纱代子。本来演出结束后，我就打算安排个庆功宴。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_114_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_114_fc_01_1031_036kan", "source_sha256": "2ef5ba407c28dd97a147c71161a67ddd82f3e604aa01689a6d6e912bc0b354f4", "ja": "ごく……。\nということは、もしかして……？", "zh": "咕咚……  \n也就是说，难道……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_114_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_114_fc_01_1032_p", "source_sha256": "0d291880f7a5d7146b7c289fdcd715b5bdb964f052b8f1bc17d6e951a3b69682", "ja": "ああ。ステージが上手くいったら、連れていこう。\nだから、みんなに最高のクリスマスを届けてきてくれ！", "zh": "嗯。演出顺利的话，就带你去。\n所以，去为大家送上最棒的圣诞节吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
